{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/12/19/7607639/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"HELLO"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/12/19/7607639/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は名古屋にて全国握手会がありました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/12/19/7607639/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつものように午前中でのミニライブは16thシングル挿入歌を全部披露しました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/12/19/7607639/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会場いっぱいの声援やすごく綺麗なサイリウム！いつも感動します"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/12/19/7607639/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最初の影アナも担当させて頂いて最初からエンジン全開でしたっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/12/19/7607639/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いぇい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/12/19/7607639/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今回の握手ペアはゆったん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/12/19/7607639/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/12/19/7607639/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/12/19/7607639/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/12/19/7607639/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/12/19/7607639/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明るいレーンだった( › ·̮ ‹ )握手終わりは楽しかったねーって話ました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/12/19/7607639/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆったん、ゆったんファンの方、まあ家族のみなさん！楽しくしてくれてありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/12/19/7607639/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は個別握手会ってことで\n2日続けて来てくれた方もいて嬉しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/12/19/7607639/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時間も忘れちゃうくらいあっという間ですごくハッピーな時間でした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/12/19/7607639/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒い中ありがとう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"風邪ひきませんように"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はまあやはサンタさん着たよ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/12/19/7607639/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"行きの新幹線ではまいちゅんととなりで1時間以上ずーーーっとはなした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/12/19/7607639/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"帰りの駅までのバスもまいちゅんが隣いい？って行って隣に座って少し話して...\nなかよちなかよちっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/12/19/7607639/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵なお姉さん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/12/19/7607639/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またまいちゅんのモノマネやらせてもらうね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/12/19/7607639/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/12/19/7607639/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今日の帰りの新幹線はみさみさと"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/12/19/7607639/0017.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ペットの写真や動画をみたよー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/12/19/7607639/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ペットショップばっかり時間があれば行ってて〜って話してて、\nマルチーズとプードルのミックス犬とかが可愛くてみさみさに調べて見て〜って言って写真とか見せてオススメした"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/12/19/7607639/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2人で癒されました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/12/19/7607639/0018.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/12/19/7607639/0019.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダブルひなとまあや"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/12/19/7607639/0020.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回のホテルも1人部屋だったんだけど2日目はひなちまと一緒の部屋で寝たよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/12/19/7607639/0021.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんお話しして気づいたらまあやは寝ちゃってた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/12/19/7607639/0022.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/12/19/7607639/0016.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちまとは初期の頃からずーーーーっとなかよくてどこに行くのも隣にいる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/12/19/7607639/0023.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんでも話せる中で感謝してる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/12/19/7607639/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/12/19/7607639/0024.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽屋の席今日は隣みなみだったんだけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ずーーっとみなみの充電器使ってた！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/12/19/7607639/0025.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ごめんちゃい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/12/19/7607639/0022.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近みなみと話したりできてなかったから今日話せてよかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/12/19/7607639/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"相変わらず可愛くて、まあやの残ったケーキも食べてくれました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/12/19/7607639/0026.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また遊ぼうね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/12/19/7607639/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/12/19/7607639/0027.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてずっとろってぃーとお買い物行こうとかあそぼーっていっててやっとこの前仕事終わり一緒に買い物いきました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"原宿をぐるぐる回って裏原ってとこにも連れていってもらった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/12/19/7607639/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ろってぃーがまあやに似合う服を選んでくれて！！すっごく嬉しくてお気に入り"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/12/19/7607639/0028.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そのときまあやお財布忘れちゃっててその日夜ご飯代も洋服代もぜ〜んぶ出してくれて...\n返すね！\nっていってて、でも\nいらんよーって言われてたんだけど\nまあやは絶対に返すんだ！！！！\nって思ってたから\n次の日お金返したんだけどこっそりまあやの机の上にお金が少し帰ってきてて"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/12/19/7607639/0029.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前も一緒にお寿司屋さん行ったときろってぃーの方が多めに払ってくれたの...\n誕生日プレゼントもくれたりして...\nいつも何から何までありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/12/19/7607639/0029.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大きくなったら返すね笑えへへ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ろってぃーはまあやが体調悪い時とか連絡くれたりいつも気にかけてくれて本当に嬉しい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/12/19/7607639/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ろってぃーみたいな人になりたい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/12/19/7607639/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/12/19/7607639/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/12/19/7607639/0030.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"bye"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2016/12/19/7607639/0031.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}